Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:46:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Event Timers: the folded view side by side
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Folded, the next events, the bosses due soon and the later ones stood
under each other, so a wide, low window showed only the first of them.
A button at the top of the folded view (and Settings → "Folded: layout":
below each other, side by side) puts them side by side: events, the
bosses up, in their window or due within 15 minutes, and the later
bosses within the chosen time, a column each with its heading, as a
wide bar. Too narrow for that, the columns wrap under each other.
Below each other is as before, with an "Events" heading over the events
that holds the button.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBQati3x8VviBbpY9juEWf
